FEATURES=OpenSSH (the Windows capability) did not install: on Server 2019 it
is a feature on demand that only Windows Update provides, and baseline runs
are offline (full/features.log: sshd not found). This run therefore equals
stock. The OpenSSH baseline for 2019 is win2019-std-desktop-ssh-g1 (the
Win32-OpenSSH MSI, offline).
